constexpr bool FU_SMALL_ONLY = true;
// F_V714_CROWD (item 3, M1157649 round 35-38: our 7, 3 long, walked north to pearls beside four enemy heads with none of ours near;
// a split child of theirs was born facing it and rammed it). A small dragon's goal (a pearl, a hunt, an errand) with CR_MIN or
// more enemy heads within CR_R of it (in view, or the memory's of the last CR_TTL rounds) and more of them than our heads there
// (us included) is dropped; already inside such a crowd, it walks back toward its nearest teammates. Heads in view count by their
// moves to the tile (walls and facing counted), the memory's by distance.
constexpr bool F_V714_CROWD = true;
constexpr int CR_MIN = 2, CR_R = 3, CR_TTL = 2, CR_MAX_LEN = 6, CR_RETREAT_TTL = 4;
// (CR_SMALL_ONLY: small maps only. On the large maps, against the module off on 44 games: 17 wins against 23, our queen alive at
// the end in 19 against 26, though outnumbered turns by moves fell 14% and deaths there 15%; on small maps 33 against 37 of 56.
// The replay was Trophy.)
constexpr bool CR_SMALL_ONLY = true;
// (CR_STEP_W: the move scorer, per enemy head too many round the tile a step lands on. At 60, against the module off on 56
